# Copy to .env (never commit .env). Real values only in your environment.
SIXHATS_LLM__PROVIDER=anthropic
SIXHATS_LLM__MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
SIXHATS_LLM__ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Local OpenAI-compatible server (loopback only unless allow_non_loopback is set)
SIXHATS_LLM__LOCAL__BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1

# --- Optional cost estimate ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Set ALL THREE or none. The estimate is shown with this currency code (e.g. "USD $0.0123").
# Anthropic lists prices in USD. If you want AUD, convert the two prices to AUD yourself and set
# PRICE_CURRENCY=AUD; the app does no currency conversion.
# SIXHATS_RUN__PRICE_INPUT_PER_MTOK=2.0
# SIXHATS_RUN__PRICE_OUTPUT_PER_MTOK=10.0
# SIXHATS_RUN__PRICE_CURRENCY=USD
#
# Base list prices, USD per million tokens, from https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing
# (checked 2026-10-13; prices change, so re-check before relying on them):
#   Model                         Input    Output
#   Claude Sonnet 5.5             $2       $10      <- the default model above
#   Claude Opus 5.5               $4       $20
#   Claude Haiku 5.5              $0.10    $0.50    (prompts over 100K tokens: $0.50 / $2.50)
#   Claude Fable 5.1              $10      $50
# Notes: US-only inference (inference_geo "us") costs 1.1x. The Batch API is 50% off, but this app does
# not use it. Prompt caching is not used by this app, so cache prices do not apply.
